37. Highest-priced product in each category

A simple and reliable approach is:

CREATE VIEW highest_category_products AS
SELECT e.*
FROM electronics e
WHERE e.price = (
    SELECT MAX(e2.price)
    FROM electronics e2
    WHERE e2.category = e.category
);

This handles categories that have more than one product tied at the highest price.

