40. Final combined view

This question asks for filtering + calculated column + alias + ORDER BY.

CREATE VIEW final_customer_product_view AS
SELECT product_name AS product,
       category,
       price,
       stock,
       price * stock AS total_stock_value,
       CASE
           WHEN price >= 50000 THEN 'High-End'
           ELSE 'Standard'
       END AS product_type
FROM electronics
WHERE status = 'Available'
  AND stock > 0
ORDER BY price DESC;

Then display it:

SELECT *
FROM final_customer_product_view;